<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Florian Zenker's website</title><id>tag:znkr.io,2024:articles</id><link rel="self" href="https://flo.znkr.io/feed.atom"/><updated>2025-07-09T00:00:00+00:00</updated><entry><title>Prose</title><id>tag:znkr.io,2024:articles/prose</id><link rel="alternate" href="https://flo.znkr.io/prose"/><published>2025-07-08T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-07-09T00:00:00+00:00</updated><author><name>Florian Zenker</name></author><summary type="html">An article covering the markup an article is written in.</summary><content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The first paragraph is the lede.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="inline-markup"&gt;Inline Markup&lt;a href="#inline-markup" class="anchor-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A paragraph with &lt;em&gt;emphasis&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;strong text&lt;/strong&gt;, “smart quotes”, a &lt;a href="https://example.com"&gt;link&lt;/a&gt;, and a footnote.&lt;sup id="fnref:1"&gt;&lt;a href="#fn:1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="note"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; Library bindings are available without an import.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id="a-nested-heading"&gt;A Nested Heading&lt;a href="#a-nested-heading" class="anchor-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deeper than the one before it, so the table of contents nests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="blocks"&gt;Blocks&lt;a href="#blocks" class="anchor-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Column A&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Column B&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;a&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;b&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A raw block, highlighted by its language:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="hl-b"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; unrelated() {}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And one without a language:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;a raw block&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;h2 id="variables"&gt;Variables&lt;a href="#variables" class="anchor-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This doc is a article.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes"&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li id="fn:1"&gt;The footnote body. &lt;a href="#fnref:1" role="doc-backlink"&gt;&amp;#8617;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</content></entry><entry><title>Diffs</title><id>tag:znkr.io,2024:articles/diffs</id><link rel="alternate" href="https://flo.znkr.io/diffs"/><published>2025-05-06T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-05-06T00:00:00+00:00</updated><author><name>Florian Zenker</name></author><summary type="html">An article that includes diffs, so that include-diff stays covered.</summary><content type="html">&lt;h2 id="from-a-diff-file"&gt;From A Diff File&lt;a href="#from-a-diff-file" class="anchor-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
